        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/cfd09ec29569f194312b1ea8c619a793e1ffc009",
          "sha": "cfd09ec29569f194312b1ea8c619a793e1ffc009",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/cfd09ec29569f194312b1ea8c619a793e1ffc009"
        }
      ],
      "message": "qt: report a settings write that did not reach disk\n\nOptionsModel::setOption only reported failure on a parse error, so a\nwrite that never landed closed the dialog with no sign of it, and\nQDataWidgetMapper::submit() does not propagate what setData returns, so\nreading its result would not have helped. setRestartRequired() was\ncalled the same way, so the user was also told to restart, and the\nrestart would drop the in-memory change rather than apply it.\n\nRecord a failed write on the model, warn once the dialog has submitted,\nand only ask for a restart when the writes succeeded.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "jeanpablo",
        "email": "jpnmoreira15@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-09-07T00:59:09Z"
      },
